{
  "info": {
    "name": "Heart Disease Prediction - Admin & Seed",
    "_postman_id": "hd-prediction-api-2026-admin-seed",




    "description": "Seed & admin utilities for backend testing.\nBackend: http://localhost:5000",

    "description": "Seed & admin utilities (not a public frontend flow).\n\n- Labs: create/list (JWT on POST)\n- Hospitals: create/update/delete need JWT + x-admin-key (see requireAdminKey / ADMIN_API_KEY in Backend .env)\n- Lab tests: bulk CSV upload (JWT)\n- Predictions: same gateway as production — POST /api/predictions/start, GET .../shap, GET .../report (JWT). Do not call FastAPI :8000 for /predict, /shap, /report from clients.\n\nBackend: http://localhost:5000",


    "description": "Seed & admin utilities (not a public frontend flow).\n\n- Labs: create/list (JWT on POST)\n- Hospitals: create/update/delete need JWT + x-admin-key (see requireAdminKey / ADMIN_API_KEY in Backend .env)\n- Lab tests: CSV upload via /api/lab-portal with x-lab-key (LAB_API_KEY in Backend .env; no patient JWT)\n- Predictions: same gateway as production — POST /api/predictions/start, GET .../shap, GET .../report (JWT). Do not call FastAPI :8000 for /predict, /shap, /report from clients.\n\nBackend: http://localhost:5000",


    "description": "Seed & admin utilities (not a public frontend flow).\n\n- Labs: create/list (JWT on POST)\n- Hospitals: create/update/delete need JWT + x-admin-key (see requireAdminKey / ADMIN_API_KEY in Backend .env)\n- Lab tests: CSV upload via /api/lab-portal with x-lab-key (LAB_API_KEY in Backend .env; no patient JWT). ECG WFDB: POST /api/lab-portal/ecg with x-lab-id.\n- Predictions: POST /api/predictions/start, GET .../shap, GET .../report (JWT). ECG patient flow: folder ECG — /api/ecg/*.\n\nBackend: http://localhost:5000",
    "description": "Seed & admin utilities (not a public frontend flow).\n\n- Labs: create/list (JWT on POST)\n- Hospitals: create/update/delete need JWT + x-admin-key (see requireAdminKey / ADMIN_API_KEY in Backend .env)\n- Lab tests: CSV upload via /api/lab-portal with x-lab-key (LAB_API_KEY in Backend .env; no patient JWT)\n- Predictions: same gateway as production — POST /api/predictions/start, GET .../shap, GET .../report (JWT). Do not call FastAPI :8000 for /predict, /shap, /report from clients.\n\nBackend: http://localhost:5000",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
